  "goodToKnow": "Schubsen means to push or shove, colloquially: jemanden zur Seite schubsen, im Gedränge schubsen. Der Schubs is a push or nudge, and figuratively einen Schubs brauchen means to need a nudge to get going. Related: drängeln (to jostle, to push in a queue), stoßen (to push, bump). Regular: schubste, geschubst."
